s[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202610/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]pomodoro_override.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202610/pomodoro_override.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-5z[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-5z/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Lex, parse, and describe the `==` token family[/bold #D7AFFF]                [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]override-grammar[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]override-grammar: teach the capture language the `==` family (`==`, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`==<X>`, `==[<X>]#name`, `…~<K>`) with `=`-identical claim rules, prose [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]protection for Obsidian highlights, teaching near-miss errors, chain [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]support, the additive capture-parse `override: true` spec flag, editor [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]needs, and `==#` name-completion offsets.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Execute restarts and the idle fallback, with the override JSON[bold black on #FFD75F][/bold #D7AFFF] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]contract[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]override-restart[dim] · [dim][/dim]after override-grammar[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]override-restart: route override starts in the executor, run the idle [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]fallback, restart the running session in place with fresh `se<X>` [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]timing, introduce the full `pomodoro_start.override` JSON object and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`restarted` human output, and start the new docs section.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Execute swaps with ledger takeover and first-future demotion[/bold #D7AFFF]  [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]override-swap[dim] · [dim][/dim]after override-restart[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]override-swap: implement `==[<X>]#name` (resolve exactly like `=#name`, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]transfer or re-time the session ledger, demote the old running block to [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]first future with contents intact), fill the `demoted` JSON, `swapped` [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]human output, `=x0` equivalence tests, updated teaching errors, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]finish every bob-cli doc surface.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Give the `==#` name picker its override context[/bold #D7AFFF]               [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]override-complete[dim] · [dim][/dim]after override-grammar[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]override-complete: add the additive top-level `override` object [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF](keeps_ledger plus the running session) to `bob capture-complete` for [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`==` name fields, with tests and the capture-complete docs.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Bob Mac Capture restart and swap preview, footer, and [/bold #D7AFFF]        [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]notifications[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]mac-override-card[dim] · [dim][/dim]after override-swap[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mac-override-card: decode the parse flag and `pomodoro_start.override`, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]extend the start presentation with restart/swap/idle variants, render [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the before→after and demoted rows on the start card, retitle the footer [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and notifications, and add real-bob fixtures, tests, and README rows.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Bob Mac Capture `==#` picker status and row hints[/bold #D7AFFF]             [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]mac-override